    },
    "difficulty": "advanced",
    "learningObjectives": {
      "en": [
        "Explain the core decision rules behind taking partial profits without destroying expected value.",
        "Apply taking partial profits without destroying expected value to chart evidence without promising a trading outcome.",
        "Document invalidation and risk controls before demonstrating the skill."
      ],
      "zh": [
        "解释在不破坏期望值的前提下分批止盈背后的核心决策规则。",
        "将在不破坏期望值的前提下分批止盈应用于图表证据，同时不承诺交易结果。",
        "在展示技能前记录失效条件与风险控制。"
      ]
    },
